      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.04 (up from ₹0.23 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹9.62b (down 4.5% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹80.7m (up ₹469.9m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.8% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 20% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 10% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
